      "startup_config": "hostname Leaf1\n!\nip routing\n!\nvlan 101\n name Rack1\n!\ninterface Loopback0\n ip address 10.255.1.1 255.255.255.255\n no shutdown\n!\ninterface HundredGigE1/0/49\n description Spine1\n no switchport\n ip address 10.0.11.2 255.255.255.252\n ip ospf network point-to-point\n!\ninterface HundredGigE1/0/50\n description Spine2\n no switchport\n ip address 10.0.21.2 255.255.255.252\n ip ospf network point-to-point\n!\ninterface TenGigabitEthernet1/0/1\n switchport access vlan 101\n switchport mode access\n!\ninterface TenGigabitEthernet1/0/2\n switchport access vlan 101\n switchport mode access\n!\ninterface Vlan101\n description Rack 1\n ip address 10.1.1.1 255.255.255.0\n!\nrouter ospf 1\n router-id 10.255.1.1\n passive-interface default\n no passive-interface HundredGigE1/0/49\n no passive-interface HundredGigE1/0/50\n network 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255 area 0\n!\nend\n",
